{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p012a","title":"曹操设五色棒并严行夜禁","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p012a-account","label":"《曹瞒传》","text":"《曹瞒传》记曹操设五色棒惩治犯禁者，蹇硕叔父因夜行被杀。","evidence":["wudi-e-p012a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"执行禁令","evidence":["wudi-e-p012a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"洛阳","evidence":["wudi-e-p012a-q"]},"time":{"label":"初任北部尉及后数月","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p012a-q"]},"source_order":[1,38,"P012a"],"order":22}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p012a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b7b24d0a76c82d24c36f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《曹瞒传》曰：“太祖初入尉廨，缮治四门。造五色棒，悬门左右各十余枚。有犯禁者，不避豪强，皆棒杀之。后数月，灵帝爱幸小黄门蹇硕叔父夜行，即杀之。京师敛迹，莫敢犯者。近习宠臣咸疾之，然不能伤。于是共称荐之，故迁为顿丘令。”","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2f620b459c537adbf4c0","start":0,"end":112,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
